WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:15.505
"What are we going to do now?"

2
00:00:15.746 --> 00:00:16.486
cried Wukong.

3
00:00:16.506 --> 00:00:19.907
"One-Horned Buffalo stole all our weapons!"

4
00:00:21.508 --> 00:00:22.828
warrior rubbed his chin.

5
00:00:23.409 --> 00:00:24.769
He looked very serious.

6
00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:27.670
"We can't go back to the Jade Emperor.

7
00:00:28.531 --> 00:00:31.492
He'll be angry if he finds out we couldn't arrest the demon."

8
00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.501
right," said the fire god.

9
00:00:34.521 --> 00:00:36.582
"We need a different plan.

10
00:00:37.562 --> 00:00:39.363
It's getting dark out, almost nighttime.

11
00:00:40.203 --> 00:00:43.565
Maybe one of us can sneak into the cave and steal that metal ring."

12
00:00:44.885 --> 00:00:46.166
thunder god smiled.

13
00:00:46.186 --> 00:00:48.467
"I know who's perfect for that job."

14
00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:51.268
The others all looked at the god.

15
00:00:51.288 --> 00:00:56.430
"One of us is a master thief," the thunder god continued.

16
00:00:56.450 --> 00:01:00.352
"He once stole all the peaches from the Royal Peach Garden."

17
00:01:02.308 --> 00:01:04.269
Now everyone looked at Wukong.

18
00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:07.190
monkey pretended to laugh.

19
00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:09.991
"Ha-ha. Yes, it's true.

20
00:01:10.812 --> 00:01:14.253
I used to steal things, but I know now that stealing is wrong.

21
00:01:15.233 --> 00:01:19.075
However, I will steal that metal ring because I need to save the Tang Monk.

22
00:01:20.235 --> 00:01:21.036
You all wait here."

23
00:01:21.996 --> 00:01:25.498
The monkey turned himself into a tiny bug and flew into the cave.

24
00:01:27.358 --> 00:01:30.920
He went down a long, dark tunnel followed by another tunnel.

25
00:01:34.444 --> 00:01:36.626
Then he heard One-Horned Buffalo.

26
00:01:36.646 --> 00:01:39.528
Wukong flew toward the voice.

27
00:01:40.588 --> 00:01:43.890
The demon was sitting on the edge of a bed, talking to himself.

28
00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:47.593
The metal ring was still on his arm.

29
00:01:47.613 --> 00:01:52.536
"It's time for bed," said the demon with a yawn.

30
00:01:52.556 --> 00:01:55.718
"I hope I can eat the Tang Monk tomorrow.

31
00:01:59.101 --> 00:02:03.584
I couldn't eat him today because of that annoying monkey and his friends from Heaven."

32
00:02:05.696 --> 00:02:07.757
The demon lay down and was soon asleep.

33
00:02:09.698 --> 00:02:12.500
Wukong flew over and landed on the demon's arm.

34
00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.962
"I'll bite his arm," thought the monkey.

35
00:02:15.982 --> 00:02:19.084
"He'll get itchy and have to take off the metal ring."

36
00:02:20.024 --> 00:02:22.806
Wukong bit the demon's arm again and again.

37
00:02:24.287 --> 00:02:32.831
The demon rolled over and mumbled in his sleep, "Bugs itchy He scratched his arm.

38
00:02:35.892 --> 00:02:37.273
Wukong bit him some more.

39
00:02:38.635 --> 00:02:40.256
demon scratched and scratched.

40
00:02:40.316 --> 00:02:42.318
But he didn't take off the metal ring.

41
00:02:43.739 --> 00:02:45.801
"This isn't working," thought Wukong.

42
00:02:46.702 --> 00:02:49.985
He was about to leave the room when he spotted some things in the corner.

43
00:02:51.066 --> 00:02:51.806
He gasped.

44
00:02:51.826 --> 00:02:53.067
"Our weapons!"

45
00:02:54.429 --> 00:02:56.871
Quietly he changed back into himself.

46
00:02:58.873 --> 00:03:02.216
He made his iron bar small and put it in his ear.

47
00:03:03.308 --> 00:03:07.751
Then he grabbed the flaming spear, the thunderbolt, and the sword.

48
00:03:09.633 --> 00:03:11.614
Outside the cave the others were waiting.

49
00:03:12.354 --> 00:03:13.695
The warrior made a fist.

50
00:03:14.876 --> 00:03:16.718
hope Wukong steals that metal ring.

51
00:03:17.678 --> 00:03:19.379
I am so angry at that demon!"

52
00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:22.422
am I," said the fire god.

53
00:03:22.442 --> 00:03:25.704
"I can't believe he stole my fire spear."

54
00:03:26.845 --> 00:03:28.366
thunder god held up a hand.

55
00:03:28.386 --> 00:03:32.212
"Shh. The door is opening."

56
00:03:32.372 --> 00:03:33.773
The three of them held their breath.

57
00:03:34.973 --> 00:03:37.794
When they saw Wukong peek out, they were relieved.

58
00:03:37.814 --> 00:03:40.334
"Did you get the ring?"

59
00:03:40.654 --> 00:03:41.615
asked the thunder god.

60
00:03:41.635 --> 00:03:43.715
"No, but look!"

61
00:03:44.395 --> 00:03:45.836
The monkey held up the weapons.

62
00:03:51.577 --> 00:03:52.477
done, Wukong!"

63
00:03:52.818 --> 00:03:53.738
said the fire god.

64
00:03:54.558 --> 00:03:56.579
The thunder god clapped the monkey on the back.

65
00:03:56.599 --> 00:03:58.559
"Thank you, Wukong."

66
00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:01.780
The warrior held up his sword.

67
00:04:03.056 --> 00:04:03.776
all armed.

68
00:04:04.377 --> 00:04:06.437
We can easily defeat the demon now."

69
00:04:08.618 --> 00:04:09.918
right," said Wukong.

70
00:04:10.498 --> 00:04:11.338
He looked around.

71
00:04:11.358 --> 00:04:13.299
"Is everyone ready?"

72
00:04:14.739 --> 00:04:16.260
"Yes!" said the warrior.

73
00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.760
"Yes!" said the fire god.

74
00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:21.701
"Yes!" said the thunder god.

75
00:04:24.322 --> 00:04:25.962
monkey banged on the cave door.

76
00:04:25.982 --> 00:04:28.143
"Wake up, One-Horned Buffalo!

77
00:04:28.943 --> 00:04:31.864
Get out here right now or we'll destroy your entire mountain!"

78
00:04:34.284 --> 00:04:36.145
demon stepped outside, yawning.

79
00:04:39.267 --> 00:04:40.448
Then he saw the weapons.

80
00:04:42.309 --> 00:04:44.771
dare you steal from me!"

81
00:04:44.791 --> 00:04:46.212
He held up the metal ring.

82
00:04:47.513 --> 00:04:51.936
Before anyone could react, the weapons were sucked into it once again.
